      <section id="sec_d461e7">
         <p>This section describes the information and specifications related to magnetic field sensor on the SMS.</p>
         <p>Measurement of the magnetic field around a motor allows for insights into electrical and mechanical motor performance issues.</p>
         <p>ADI OtoSense™ SMS is equipped with a single magnetic field sensor For specifications, ￼Table ￼.</p>
